@startuml lld-us4-class
title LLD-US4 Lock access after 3 failed logins: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class AuthService <<service>> {
  + checkPassword()
}
class Lockout <<component>> {
  - maxFailures = 3
  - lockHours = 24
  + fail(id)
  + reset(id)
  + isLocked(id)
}
class SmsGateway <<external>> {
  + send()
}
AuthService --> Lockout
Lockout ..> SmsGateway : notifies
@enduml